.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="VibrationalPartitionFunctionHarmonic&#x27;s heat capacity is the Einstein-oscillator formula: it vanishes as T\to0 (the vibration is &quot;frozen out&quot;) and approaches the classical equipartition value k_B per mode as T\to\infty. Separately, sackur_tetrode_entropy gives the translational entropy of an ideal gas directly from its molecular mass, temperature, and pressure -- checked here against the standard tabulated value for argon.">

